  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量本地推-本地推\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量本地推\"],\"capability_summary\":\"通过指定本地推投放账户ID和过滤条件等，获取素材库视频列表及相关信息，可根据视频上传时间、素材类型、素材来源、评估类型等进行筛选和排序，支持分页。可配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。\",\"id\":\"local.file_video.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1808613640441882\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用该接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1808613640441882\",\"title\":\"获取素材库视频\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\">\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201808531709387851%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1QmOFiNf\" id=\"h346b9f0-1QmOFiNf\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-aLgaCAEH\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/local/file/video/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1808613640441882\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BRoTfc20\" id=\"h346b9f0-BRoTfc20\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-MMmZHtCb\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-j3d8Yn4b\" id=\"h346b9f0-j3d8Yn4b\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HopxHPpi\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-LKhIaji3\" id=\"h346b9f0-LKhIaji3\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">local_account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UofC6jCB\">本地推投放账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ogqD8stG\">过滤器</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_key_word</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3nNaxBJ0\">根据视频素材名称或素材ID筛选</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">image_mode</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pQ9OZvoB\">素材类型 允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0mWLsP0c\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PitvTzzV\"><code>IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO</code> 横版视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4XQPBccW\"><code>IMAGE_MODE_VIDEO_VERTICAL</code> 竖版视频</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">material_source</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-io87E0Bh\">素材来源 允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6YouJfFb\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-imo8QASe\"><br/><code>BP_PLATFORM</code> 巨量引擎工作平台共享视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-u5ffU4kZ\"><code>CREATIVE_AIGC</code> 即创</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5z49tInM\"><code>LOCAL_ADS_UPLOAD</code> 本地上传</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ZIrV8Rkk\"><code>STAR</code> 星图平台</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rsQw5Zv5\"><code><span style=\"color: #323335;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fbfcfc;\">MAPI</span></span></code> MAPI上传</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">analysis_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Jd3o4ITR\">评估类型 允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-cdYtwuSm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-117U3sZJ\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH</code> 首发</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-g3K7Yl6n\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH_AND_HIGH_QUALITY</code>首发&amp;优质</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Qorp24hF\"><code>HIGH_QUALITY</code>优质</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S0hyaIYf\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">根据视频上传时间进行过滤的起始时间，与end_time搭配使用，格式：</span><code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7xf20wXF\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"></span><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">根据视频上传时间，进行过滤的截止时间，与start_time搭配使用，格式：</span><code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss</span></code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_filter_unqualified</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ChdXapFX\">是否过滤低质素材，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-we8RSOTC\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CDvcr0ef\"><code>false</code>不过滤</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8nqRNScI\"><code>true</code>过滤（默认值）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nYmuEyHc\">排序字段，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-BrtWkwqa\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4kg7AbP5\"><code>CONVERSION_COST</code> 转化成本</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pt5U8nrQ\"><code>CONVERSION_RATE</code> 转化率</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fHCOoEnr\"><code>CREATE_TIME</code> 创建时间（默认值）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ubhFDaKn\"><code>CTR</code> 点击率</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-js6MYXKu\"><code>DURATION</code> 视频时长</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YUlUYprJ\"><code>STAT_COST</code> 消耗</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6VTJ1b2m\">排序顺序，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-obgu5mcC\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pYQmhPjr\"><code>ASC</code> 升序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LB6cE1K5\"><code>DESC</code> 降序（默认值） </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eP1QcT16\">页码，默认值：<code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rx1f6yca\">页面大小，默认值：<code>20</code>，最大值：<code>100</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cKjF85BS\" id=\"h346b9f0-cKjF85BS\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Flocal%2Ffile%2Fvideo%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%2